ght: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="61%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 5.9pt; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Корхонанинг тўлиқ номи, манзили ва реквизитлари кўрсатилади</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 4; height: 14.2pt;"><td style="width: 5.42%; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="5%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">2.</span></p></td><td style="width: 32.82%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="32%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Корхоналарни энергия аудитидан ўтказиш учун асос</span></p></td><td style="width: 61.76%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="61%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 5.9pt; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Корхонани энергия аудитидан ўтказиш учун асос бўлган Вазирлар Маҳкамаси қарори ва фармойиши, баённомалари ва бошқалар (рақами ва санаси) кўрсатилади</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 5; height: 14.2pt;"><td style="width: 5.42%; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="5%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">3.</span></p></td><td style="width: 32.82%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="32%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Энергия аудити тури</span></p></td><td style="width: 61.76%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="61%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 5.9pt; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Энергия аудитининг тури кўрсатилади (дастлабки, даврий ва навбатдан ташқари, экспресс)</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 6; height: 14.2pt;"><td style="width: 5.42%; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="5%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">4.</span></p></td><td style="width: 32.82%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="32%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Корхонанинг фаолият тури</span></p></td><td style="width: 61.76%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="61%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 5.9pt; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Корхонада қандай маҳсулот (хизмат) ишлаб чиқарилиши кўрсатилади</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 7; height: 14.2pt;"><td style="width: 5.42%; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="5%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">5.</span></p></td><td style="width: 32.82%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="32%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Корхонанинг ташкилий тузилмаси</span></p></td><td style="width: 61.76%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="61%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 5.9pt; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Корхона таркибидаги бўлинмаларнинг функционал вазифалари, унда амалга ошириладиган фаолиятнинг таснифи кўрсатилади</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 8; height: 14.2pt;"><td style="width: 5.42%; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="5%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">6.</span></p></td><td style="width: 32.82%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="32%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Энергия аудитининг молиялаштириш манбалари</span></p></td><td style="width: 61.76%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="61%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 5.9pt; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Корхонанинг ўз маблағлари, бюджет маблағлари ва бошқалар кўрсатилади</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 9; height: 14.2pt;"><td style="width: 5.42%; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="5%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">7.</span></p></td><td style="width: 32.82%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="32%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Энергия аудитини ўтказиш объектлари</span></p></td><td style="width: 61.76%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="61%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 5.9pt; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Корхонани энергия аудитидан ўтказишда қуйидаги объектлар ўрганилиши лозим:</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 5.9pt; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">маъмурий ва ишлаб чиқариш бино ва иншоатлари;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 5.9pt; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR; mso-fareast-language: RU;">электр таъминоти тизими ва электр қурилмалари (подстанциялар, трансформаторлар, электр тармоқлари ва қурилмалари);</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 5.9pt; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">иссиқлик энергияси таъминоти (қозонхона, иссиқлик тармоқлари, буғ қувурлари, конденсат қувурлари) ва барча иссиқлик ҳамда ёқилғи истеъмол қилувчи қурилмалар;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 5.9pt; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">газ таъминоти тизими (газ тақсимлаш пунктлари, газ қувурлари ва қурилмалари);</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 5.9pt; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">ёнилғи-мойлаш маҳсулотларини ҳисобга олиш, қабул қилиш, сақлаш ва тарқатиш мосламалари;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 5.9pt; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">сиқилган ҳаво таъминоти ва техник газлар тизими (компрессор станциялари, тарқатиш тармоқлари ва қурилмалар);</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 5.9pt; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">энергия ресурсларини ҳисобга олиш тизими ва воситалари</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 10; height: 14.2pt;"><td style="width: 5.42%; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: .5pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: 1.0pt; mso-border-right-alt: 1.0pt; mso-border-color-alt: windowtext; mso-border-style-alt: solid; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="5%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">8.</span></p></td><td style="width: 32.82%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="32%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Энергия аудиторининг вазифалари</span></p></td><td style="width: 61.76%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="61%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 5.9pt; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Корхонани энергия аудитидан ўтказишда энергия аудитори томонидан амалга ошириладиган ишлар аниқ ва кетма-кетликда келтирилади</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 11; height: 14.2pt;"><td style="width: 5.42%; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="5%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">9.</span></p></td><td style="width: 32.82%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="32%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Энергия аудитидан ўтказишнинг алоҳида шартлари</span></p></td><td style="width: 61.76%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="61%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 5.9pt; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Энергия аудитидан ўтказиладиган корхонанинг хусусиятлари ва ўзига хослигидан келиб чиқиб, энергия аудиторининг малакаси ва тажрибасига қўйиладиган талаблар кўрсатилади</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 12; height: 14.2pt;"><td style="width: 5.42%; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="5%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">10.</span></p></td><td style="width: 32.82%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="32%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Энергия аудитидан ўтказиш муддатлари</span></p></td><td style="width: 61.76%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="61%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 5.9pt; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Корхоналарни энергия аудитдан ўтказишнинг аниқ муддатлари (ой) кўрсатилади</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 13; height: 14.2pt;"><td style="width: 5.42%; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="5%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">11.</span></p></td><td style="width: 32.82%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="32%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Энергия аудитидан ўтказишда расмийлаштириладиган ҳужжатлар</span></p></td><td style="width: 61.76%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="61%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 5.9pt; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Энергия аудитидан ўтказишда ишлаб чиқиладиган ҳужжатлар тури ва уларни расмийлаштириш бўйича талаблар келтирилади</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 14; height: 14.2pt;"><td style="width: 5.42%; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="5%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">12.</span></p></td><td style="width: 32.82%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="32%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Энергия самарадорлигини оширишга қаратилган ташкилий-техник тадбирларга қўйиладиган талаблар</span></p></td><td style="width: 61.76%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="61%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 5.9pt; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Энергияни тежашга қаратилган ташкилий-техник тадбирлар, иқтисод қилинадиган энергиянинг физик миқдорини ҳамда уларни амалга ошириш учун харажатларни ўз ичига олган бўлиши лозим</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 15; height: 14.2pt;"><td style="width: 5.42%; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="5%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">13.</span></p></td><td style="width: 32.82%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="32%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Иш натижаларини тақдим қилиш бўйича талаблар</span></p></td><td style="width: 61.76%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="61%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 5.9pt; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Энергия аудити натижасида ишлаб чиқиладиган ҳисобот, энергетика паспорти, энергияни тежашга қаратилган ташкилий-техник тадбирларни тақдим қилиш шаклига қўйиладиган талаблар кўрсатилади</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 16; height: 14.2pt;"><td style="width: 5.42%; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="5%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">14.</span></p></td><td style="width: 32.82%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="32%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Бирламчи ҳужжатлар рўйхати</span></p></td><td style="width: 61.76%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="61%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 5.9pt; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Корхонани энергия аудитидан ўтказиш учун зарур бўлган, энергия аудиторининг талаби билан истеъмолчи томонидан мазкур техник топшириққа илова кўринишида бериладиган барча бирламчи ҳужжатлар кўрсатилади</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 17; height: 14.2pt;"><td style="width: 5.42%; border: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="5%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;"> </span></p></td><td style="width: 32.82%; border: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="32%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;"><span lang=