family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Бино ва иншоотларни энергия аудитидан ўтказиш учун асос бўлган Вазирлар Маҳкамаси қарори ва фармойиши, баённомалар ва бошқалар (рақами ва санаси) кўрсатилади</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 8; height: 14.2pt;"><td style="width: 5.52%; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="5%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">3.</span></p></td><td style="width: 32.78%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="32%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Энергия аудити тури</span></p></td><td style="width: 61.7%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="61%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 14.6pt; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Энергия аудити тури кўрсатилади (дастлабки, даврий ва навбатдан ташқари)</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 9; height: 14.2pt;"><td style="width: 5.52%; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="5%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">4.</span></p></td><td style="width: 32.78%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="32%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Энергия аудити ўтказишнинг қиймати</span></p></td><td style="width: 61.7%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="61%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 14.6pt; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Энергия аудити ўтказишнинг ҳисоб-китоб қилинган умумий қиймати кўрсатилади.</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 10; height: 14.2pt;"><td style="width: 5.52%; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="5%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">5.</span></p></td><td style="width: 32.78%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="32%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Бино ва иншоот тури</span></p></td><td style="width: 61.7%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="61%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 14.6pt; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Бино ва иншоот тури кўрсатилади (кўп квартирали уй, ижтимоий соҳа ва жамоат бино ва иншоотлари)</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 11; height: 14.2pt;"><td style="width: 5.52%; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="5%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">6.</span></p></td><td style="width: 32.78%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="32%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Бино ва иншоотнинг функционал вазифаси</span></p></td><td style="width: 61.7%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="61%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 14.6pt; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Бино ва иншоотнинг функционал вазифаси, унда амалга ошириладиган фаолиятнинг таснифи кўрсатилади</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 12; height: 14.2pt;"><td style="width: 5.52%; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="5%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">7.</span></p></td><td style="width: 32.78%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="32%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Корхонанинг ишлаш тартиби</span></p></td><td style="width: 61.7%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="61%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 14.6pt; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Энергия аудити ўтказиладиган объектнинг йил давомидаги иш билан таъминланганлик даражаси, иш сменалари кўрсатилади</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 13; height: 14.2pt;"><td style="width: 5.52%; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="5%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">8.</span></p></td><td style="width: 32.78%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="32%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Корхона таркиби</span></p></td><td style="width: 61.7%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="61%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 14.6pt; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Корхона ҳудудида мавжуд бино ва иншоотлар сони ва қаватлилига кўрсатилади</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 14; height: 14.2pt;"><td style="width: 5.52%; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="5%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">9.</span></p></td><td style="width: 32.78%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="32%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Энергия аудитининг молиялаштириш манбалари</span></p></td><td style="width: 61.7%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="61%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 14.6pt; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Буюртмачининг ўз маблағлари, бюджет маблағлари ва бошқалар кўрсатилади</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 15; height: 14.2pt;"><td style="width: 5.52%; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="5%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">10.</span></p></td><td style="width: 32.78%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="32%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Энергия аудити ўтказиш объектлари</span></p></td><td style="width: 61.7%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="61%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 14.6pt; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Бино ва иншоотларни энергия аудитини ўтказишда текширилиши ва ўрганилиши лозим бўлган бино конструкциясининг қисмлари, энергия таъминоти тизимлари, иситиш ва ёритиш жиҳозлари, энергия истеъмол қиладиган жиҳозлар ва ускуналар, шунингдек ёқилғи-энергетика ресурслари истеъмол қиладиган барча объектлар аниқ ва тўлиқ келтирилади</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 16; height: 14.2pt;"><td style="width: 5.52%; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="5%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">11.</span></p></td><td style="width: 32.78%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="32%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Энергия аудиторининг вазифалари</span></p></td><td style="width: 61.7%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="61%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 14.6pt; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Бино ва иншоотларни энергия аудитидан ўтказишда энергия аудитори томонидан амалга ошириладиган ишлар аниқ, кетма-кетликда келтирилади</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 17; height: 14.2pt;"><td style="width: 5.52%; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="5%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">12.</span></p></td><td style="width: 32.78%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="32%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Энергия самарадорлигини оширишга қаратилган ташкилий-техник тадбирларга қўйиладиган талаблар</span></p></td><td style="width: 61.7%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="61%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 14.6pt; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Энергияни тежашга қаратилган ташкилий-техник тадбирлар, иқтисод қилинадиган энергиянинг физик миқдорини ҳамда уларни амалга ошириш учун харажатларни ўз ичига олган бўлиши лозим</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 18; height: 14.2pt;"><td style="width: 5.52%; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="5%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">13.</span></p></td><td style="width: 32.78%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="32%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Энергия аудитидан ўтказишнинг алоҳида шартлари</span></p></td><td style="width: 61.7%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="61%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 14.6pt; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Энергия аудитидан ўтказиладиган бино ва иншоотнинг хусусиятлари ва ўзига хослигидан келиб чиқиб, энергия аудиторига қўйиладиган талаблар бўлиши лозим</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 19; height: 14.2pt;"><td style="width: 5.52%; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="5%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">14.</span></p></td><td style="width: 32.78%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="32%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Бино ва иншоотларни энергия аудитидан ўтказиш муддатлари</span></p></td><td style="width: 61.7%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="61%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 14.6pt; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Энергия аудитидан ўтказишнинг аниқ муддатлари (ой) кўрсатилади</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 20; height: 14.2pt;"><td style="width: 5.52%; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="5%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">15.</span></p></td><td style="width: 32.78%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="32%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Энергия аудитидан ўтказишда расмийлаштириладиган ҳужжатлар</span></p></td><td style="width: 61.7%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="61%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 14.6pt; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Энергия аудитидан ўтказишда ишлаб чиқиладиган ҳужжатлар тури ва уларни расмийлаштириш бўйича талаблар келтирилади</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 21; height: 14.2pt;"><td style="width: 5.52%; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="5%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">16.</span></p></td><td style="width: 32.78%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="32%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Иш натижаларини тақдим қилиш бўйича талаблар</span></p></td><td style="width: 61.7%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="61%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 14.6pt; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Энергия аудити натижасида ишлаб чиқиладиган ҳисобот, энергетика паспорти, энергия самарадорлик тоифаси ва энергия самарадорликни ошириш бўйича кўрсатмаларни тақдим қилиш шаклига қўйиладиган талаблар кўрсатилади</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 22; height: 14.2pt;"><td style="width: 5.52%; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="5%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">17.</span></p></td><td style="width: 32.78%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="32%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Бирламчи ҳужжатлар рўйхати</span></p></td><td style="width: 61.7%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="61%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 14.6pt; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Бино ва иншоотларни энергия аудитидан ўтказиш учун зарур бўлган, энергия аудиторининг талаби билан буюртмачи томонидан мазкур техник топшириққа илова кўринишида бериладиган барча бирламчи ҳужжатлар</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 23; height: 14.2pt;"><td style="width: 5.52%; border: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="5%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;"> </span></p></td><td style="width: 32.78%; border: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" valign="top" width="32%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;"> </span></p></td><td style="width: 61.7%; border: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" valign="top" width="61%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 16.15pt; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;"> </span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 24; height: 14.2pt;"><td colspan="3" style="width: 100.0%; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="100%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 36.0pt; line-height: normal;"><em><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">Изоҳ. </span></em><em><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Техник топшириқнинг асосий маълумотлари ва талаблари рўйхати энергия аудитидан ўтказиладиган объектнинг ўзига хос хусусиятлари, мураккаблиги ва энергия аудитнинг қандай мақсадга мўлжалланганлигига қараб ўзгартирилиши, кенгайтирилиши ёки қисқартирилишига йўл қўйилади.</span></em></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 25; height: 14.2pt;"><td colspan="3" style="width: 100.0%; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="100%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;"> </span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 26; height: 14.2pt;"><td colspan="3" style="width: 100.0%; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="100%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Ишлаб чиқувчилар:</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 27; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes; height: 14.2pt;"><td colspan="3" style="width: 100.0%; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="100%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Лавозими</span></strong><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;"> </span></strong><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">__________________ Ф.И.О</span></strong></p></td></tr></tbody></table></a></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><a id="7580811"></a></div><div class="APPL_BANNER_LANDSCAPE_TITLE"><a id="7580812">Ўзбекистон Республикаси Вазирлар Маҳкамаси ҳузуридаги Электр энергияси, нефть маҳсулотлари ва газдан фойдаланишни назорат қилиш инспекцияси, Энергетика вазирлиги, Қурилиш ва уй-жой коммунал хўжалиги вазирлигининг 2025 йил 8 майдаги 8, 5 қ/қ ва 4-сон <a href="javascript:scrollText()">қарорига</a><br />6-ИЛОВА</a></div><div class="ACT_TITLE_APPL"><a id="7580813"><strong>Бино ва иншоотларни энергия аудитидан ўтказиш</strong><strong>нинг</strong></a></div><div class="ACT_FORM"><a id="7580814">НАМУНАВИЙ ДАСТУРИ</a></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><a id="7580888"></a></div><div class="TABLE_STD2"><a id="7580890"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="MsoTableGrid" style="width: 100.0%; border-collapse: collapse; border: none; mso-yfti-tbllook: 480; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt; mso-border-insideh: none; mso-border-insidev: none;" width="100%"><tbody><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes; height: 14.2pt;"><td colspan="2" style="width: 100.0%; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="100%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; tab-stops: 49.65pt;"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">1.</span></strong><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;"> <strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;">Дастур қуйидаги ҳужжатлар асосида ишлаб чиқилган:</strong></span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 1; height: 14.2pt;"><td style="width: 50.0%; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="50%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; tab-stops: 49.65pt;"><strong><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;"> </span></strong></p></td><td style="width: 50.0%; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="50%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; tab-stops: 49.65pt;"><strong><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;"> </span></strong></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 2; height: 14.2pt;"><td colspan="2" style="width: 100.0%; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="100%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 36.0pt; line-height: normal; tab-stops: 49.65pt;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Ўзбекистон Республикасининг «Энергия тежаш, ундан оқилона фойдаланиш ва энергия самарадорлигини ошириш тўғрисида»ги </span><a href="http://lex.uz/ru/docs/7052085">Қонуни</a><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;"> ва Ўзбекистон Республикаси Вазирлар Маҳкамасининг «Ёқилғи-энергетика ресурслари истеъмолчиларини ҳамда бино ва иншоотларни энергия истеъмолини энергия аудитидан ўтказиш тартибларини белгилаш тўғрисида» 2024 йил 19 октябрдаги 690-сон </span><a href="http://lex.uz/ru/docs/7165199">қарори</a><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;"> ҳамда корхонанинг<span style="mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;"> </span>энергия аудитдан ўтказиш бўйича шартномасига мувофиқ ишлаб чиқилган.</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 3; height: 14.2pt;"><td style="width: 50.0%; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="50%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; tab-stops: 49.65pt;"><strong><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;"> </span></strong></p></td><td style="width: 50.0%; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="50%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; tab-stops: 49.65pt;"><strong><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;"> </span></strong></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 4; height: 14.2pt;"><td colspan="2" style="width: 100.0%; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="100%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; tab-stops: 49.65pt;"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">2. Бино ва иншоотларни энергия аудити</span></strong><strong><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;"> ўтказишда қуйидагилар ўрганилиши лозим:</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 5; height: 14.2pt;"><td style="width: 50.0%; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="50%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; tab-stops: 49.65pt;"><strong><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;"> </span></strong></p></td><td style="width: 50.0%; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="50%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; tab-stops: 49.65pt;"><strong><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;"> </span></strong></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 6; height: 14.2pt;"><td colspan="2" style="width: 100.0%; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="100%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-indent: 35.45pt; line-height: normal; tab-stops: 49.65pt;"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">а) дастлабки маълумотларни тўплаш:</span></strong></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 35.45pt; line-height: normal; tab-stops: 49.65pt;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">бино ва иншоотларнинг ҳажм-режавий ечимлари ҳамда муҳандислик тизимларининг схематик ечимлари;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 35.45pt; line-height: normal; tab-stops: 49.65pt;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">бино ва иншоотларни идентификация қилиниши;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 35.45pt; line-height: normal; tab-stops: 49.65pt;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">бино ва иншоотлардан фойдаланиш шароитлари ҳамда тартиби;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 35.45pt; line-height: normal; tab-stops: 49.65pt;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">бино ва иншоотларда илгари ўтказилган энергия самарадорлик жиҳатидан текширувлар далолатномалари ва ҳисоботлари;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 35.45pt; line-height: normal; tab-stops: 49.65pt;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">ёқилғи-энергетика ресурсларини истеъмол қилувчи қурилмаларнинг тавсифлари бўйича маълумотлар, ўлчаш воситаларининг охирги уч йиллик кўрсаткичлари;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-indent: 35.45pt; line-height: normal; tab-stops: 49.65pt;"><strong><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">б) энергия аудитини ўтказиш</span></strong><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">:</span></strong></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 35.45pt; line-height: normal; tab-stops: 49.65pt;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">бино ва иншоотларнинг ҳолати ва электр қурилмаларнинг визуал кўрикдан ўтказиш ва нуқсонлари аниқлаш;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 35.45pt; line-height: normal; tab-stops: 49.65pt;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">бино ва иншоотларнинг электр манбаи, иссиқлик таъминоти, сув, газ таъминоти ва оқава сувларни чиқариб юбориш тизимларини визуал кўрикдан ўтказиш ва нуқсонларини аниқлаш;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 35.45pt; line-height: normal; tab-stops: 2.0cm;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">бино ва иншоотнинг тўсувчи конструкцияларининг (ташқи девор, пойдевор, ойна, ташқи эшиклар, том, чордоқ, ертўла) иссиқлик ҳимояси даражаси, муҳандислик тизимлари (иситиш, электр, сув (иссиқ ва совуқ), газ таъминоти ва вентиляция, кондициялаш, ёритиш тизимлари), лифтлар ва бошқа жиҳозларнинг энергетик тавсифлари ҳамда бино ва иншоотларнинг микроиқлими техник жиҳатдан тартибга солиш соҳасидаги норматив ҳужжатлар ҳамда шаҳарсозлик нормалари ва қоидаларида белгиланган синов усуллари асосида текшириш;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 35.45pt; line-height: normal; tab-stops: 49.65pt;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">ёқилғи-энергетика ресурсларининг истеъмоли ҳажми ва йўқотилиш сабабларини аниқлаш;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-indent: 35.45pt; line-height: normal; tab-stops: 49.65pt;"><strong><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">в) натижаларни таҳлил қилиш</span></strong><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">:</span></strong></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 35.45pt; line-height: normal; tab-stops: 49.65pt;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">дастлабки маълумотлар ҳамда ўлчаш ва текширишлар натижасида тўпланган маълумотларни таҳлил қилиш;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 35.45pt; line-height: normal; tab-stops: 49.65pt;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">амалдаги кўрсаткичларни норматив қийматлар билан таққослаш;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 35.45pt; line-height: normal; tab-stops: 49.65pt;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">энергия ресурс балансларини таҳлил қилиш;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 35.45pt; line-height: normal; tab-stops: 49.65pt;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">бино ва иншоотларнинг энергия самарадорлигининг амалдаги кўрсаткичларини ҳисоблаш;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 35.45pt; line-height: normal; tab-stops: 49.65pt;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">амалдаги энергия самарадорлик кўрсаткичлари ва белгиланган норматив қийматлар ўртасидаги номувофиқлик сабабларини аниқлаши ва таҳлил қилиш;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 35.45pt; line-height: normal; tab-stops: 49.65pt;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">бино ва иншоотлар учун мумкин бўлган энергия тежаш қийматларини ҳисоблаш;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 36.0pt; line-height: normal; tab-stops: 49.65pt;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">бино ва иншоотларнинг энергия самарадорлиги тоифасини қабул қилинган кўрсаткичлар асосида белгилаш;</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 7; height: 14.2pt;"><td style="width: 50.0%; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="50%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; tab-stops: 49.65pt;"><strong><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;"> </span></strong></p></td><td style="width: 50.0%; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="50%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; tab-stops: 49.65pt;"><strong><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;"> </span></strong></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 8; height: 14.2pt;"><td colspan="2" style="width: 100.0%; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="100%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; tab-stops: 49.65pt;"><strong><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">3.</span></strong><strong><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri;"> </span></strong><strong><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Энергия аудити натижалари бўйича ҳужжатларни расмийлаштириш:</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 9; height: 14.2pt;"><td style="width: 50.0%; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="50%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; tab-stops: 49.65pt;"><strong><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;"> </span></strong></p></td><td style="width: 50.0%; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt; height: 14.2pt;" width="50%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; tab-stops: 49.65pt;"><strong><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;"> </span></strong></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-iro