m: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 8.95pt; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: DengXian; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Ўлчов каналлар сони:</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 8.95pt; line-height: normal; tab-stops: 125.65pt 12.0cm;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: DengXian; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Камида битта иссиқлик оқими учун ва ҳарорат учун эса иккидан кам эмас</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 7;"><td style="width: 5.42%; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt;" width="5%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; tab-stops: 125.65pt 12.0cm;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR; mso-fareast-language: RU;">7.</span></p></td><td style="width: 23.26%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt;" width="23%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; tab-stops: 125.65pt 12.0cm;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: DengXian; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Рақамли контактсиз термометр</span></p></td><td style="width: 71.32%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: soli