der-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt;" width="71%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 8.95pt; line-height: normal; tab-stops: 125.65pt 12.0cm;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: DengXian; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Ўлчов диапазони:</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 8.95pt; line-height: normal; tab-stops: 125.65pt 12.0cm;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: DengXian; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">0 дан 50 метргача</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 8.95pt; line-height: normal; tab-stops: 125.65pt 12.0cm;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: DengXian; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Ўлчов хатолиги: ± 0,1%дан кўп эмас</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 9;"><td style="width: 5.42%; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt;" width="5%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; tab-stops: 125.65pt 12.0cm;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR; mso-fareast-language: RU;">9.</span></p></td><td style="width: 23.26%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt;" width="23%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; tab-stops: 125.65pt 12.0cm;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: DengXian; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Анемометр</span></p></td><td style="width: 71.32%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt;" width="71%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 8.95pt; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: DengXian; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Ўлчов диапазони: 0 ... +20 м/с дан кам бўлмаган</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 8.95pt; line-height: normal;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: DengXian; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Рухсат бериш даражаси:</span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;"> </span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: DengXian; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">±(0,02 м/с + ўлчанган қийматнинг 2 %)</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 10;"><td style="width: 5.42%; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt;" width="5%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; tab-stops: 125.65pt 12.0cm;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR; mso-fareast-language: RU;">10.</span></p></td><td style="width: 23.26%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt;" width="23%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; tab-stops: 125.65pt 12.0cm;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: DengXian; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Гигрометр</span></p></td><td style="width: 71.32%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt;" width="71%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 8.95pt; line-height: normal; tab-stops: 125.65pt 12.0cm;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: DengXian; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Ўлчов диапазона: нисбий намлик 10 % дан 90 % гача , Ўлчов хатолиги:+/- 2 % нисбий намликда (+10 дан +90 % гача нисбий намлик). Ўлчаш имконияти: нисбий намликда 0,1%, Ишлаш ҳарорати: -10 дан + 50 °C гача</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 11;"><td style="width: 5.42%; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt;" width="5%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; tab-stops: 125.65pt 12.0cm;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR; mso-fareast-language: RU;">11.</span></p></td><td style="width: 23.26%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt;" width="23%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; tab-stops: 125.65pt 12.0cm;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: DengXian; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Люксметр</span></p></td><td style="width: 71.32%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt;" width="71%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 8.95pt; line-height: normal; tab-stops: 125.65pt 12.0cm;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: DengXian; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">ўлчов диапазони: 0 ... 100000 люкс</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 12;"><td style="width: 5.42%; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt;" width="5%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; tab-stops: 125.65pt 12.0cm;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR; mso-fareast-language: RU;">12.</span></p></td><td style="width: 23.26%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt;" width="23%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; tab-stops: 125.65pt 12.0cm;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: DengXian; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Манометр</span></p></td><td style="width: 71.32%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt;" width="71%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 8.95pt; line-height: normal; tab-stops: 125.65pt 12.0cm;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: DengXian; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Босим кўрсаткичи диапазони: 0-6. МПа</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 13;"><td style="width: 5.42%; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt;" width="5%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; tab-stops: 125.65pt 12.0cm;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR; mso-fareast-language: RU;">13.</span></p></td><td style="width: 23.26%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt;" width="23%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; tab-stops: 125.65pt 12.0cm;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: DengXian; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Ултратовушли суюқлик оқими ўлчагич</span></p></td><td style="width: 71.32%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt;" width="71%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 23.1pt; line-height: normal; tab-stops: 125.65pt 12.0cm;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: DengXian; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Қувурдан ўтиш диаметри: 25 дан 1200 ммгача. Ўлчанган оқим диапазонларининг юқори чегаралари: 4 дан 240 м<sup>3</sup>/соатгача. Ҳажм оқимини ўлчов хатолиги: ± 2%. Миқдорни ўлчов хатолиги: ± 2%. Назорат қилинадиган муҳит ҳарорати: -10 дан +150 °C </span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 14;"><td style="width: 5.42%; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt;" width="5%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; tab-stops: 125.65pt 12.0cm;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR; mso-fareast-language: RU;">14.</span></p></td><td style="width: 23.26%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt;" width="23%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; tab-stops: 125.65pt 12.0cm;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: DengXian; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Ултрасоник қалинлиги ўлчагич</span></p></td><td style="width: 71.32%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt;" width="71%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 23.1pt; line-height: normal; tab-stops: 125.65pt 12.0cm;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: DengXian; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Ўлчанадиган қувур ёки резервуарларнинг қалинликлар диапазони: 1÷225 мм. Ўлчов хатолиги: +/-0,5 %</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 15; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes;"><td style="width: 5.42%; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt;" width="5%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; tab-stops: 125.65pt 12.0cm;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR; mso-fareast-language: RU;">15.</span></p></td><td style="width: 23.26%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt;" width="23%"><p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; tab-stops: 125.65pt 12.0cm;"><a href="javascript:scrollText(7580970)">*</a><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: DengXian; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;">Лазерли тахометр</span></p></td><td style="width: 71.32%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: white; padding: 0cm 2.85pt 0cm 2.85pt;" width="71%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 23.1pt; line-height: normal; tab-stops: 125.65pt 12.0cm;"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR; mso-fareast-language: RU;">1 дақиқада 5 дан 50 000 гача айланишни ўлчайди. Ўлчаш имконияти: 1 дақиқада 0,1 айланиш</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></a></div><div class="FOOTNOTE"><a id="7580970"><em>Изоҳ:* — Бино ва иншоотларни энергия аудитдан ўтказишда ушбу ўлчов воситалари талаб этилмайди.</em></a></div><br /><div class="PUBLICATION_ORIGIN"><label id="s1089"></label><a id="7580442">(Қонунчилик маълумотлари миллий базаси, 18.06.2025 й., 10/25/3629/0514-сон)</a></div></div>
